OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after #200,000 of
OL,4,Acocaine seized from car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after police
OL,7,Fseized a "large quantity" of cocaine
OL,8,Ffrom a car.
OL,10,FRoad policing officers stopped the
OL,11,Fvehicle on the A90 close to Aberdeen on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,FPolice Scotland said a "substantial"
OL,15,Famount of the drug, with a street value
OL,16,Fof #200,000, was recovered.
OL,18,FThe 39-year-old was arrested and is
OL,19,Fscheduled to appear at Aberdeen Sheriff
OL,20,FCourt at a later date.
